OL,3,ANigeria's president orders manhunt
OL,4,Aafter kidnappers upload victim video
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigeria's President Bola Tinubu has
OL,7,Fordered a manhunt for armed kidnappers
OL,8,Fwho launched deadly attacks on four
OL,9,Fvillages in a remote part of Niger
OL,10,Fstate last Friday.
OL,12,FLocal residents told the BBC several
OL,13,Fmosques were simultaneously targeted
OL,14,Fduring prayers. A local youth leader
OL,15,Fsays as many as 500 people may have
OL,16,Fbeen abducted, though this has not been
OL,17,Fverified.
OL,19,FThe president's orders came after the
OL,20,Fkidnappers posted a video on social
OL,21,Fmedia of what they said were those
OL,22,Fabducted last week sitting in a forest.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
