OL,3,ANigeria's president orders manhunt
OL,4,Aafter kidnappers upload victim video
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authorities had previously
OL,7,Fsuspected the attackers were bandits -
OL,8,Fcriminal gangs involved in kidnapping
OL,9,Fand looting for ransom across parts of
OL,10,FNigeria.
